## English (translation for reference)

### 1. Scope

This license applies only to source code and documentation in this repository for which `langonginc` owns copyright (collectively, the “Code”). It does not apply to images, photographs, illustrations, icons, textures, screenshots, or other materials with independent rights holders (collectively, “Image Assets”).

### 2. Non-Commercial License

Subject to full compliance with this license, `langonginc` grants individuals and users engaged in non-commercial education, research, or learning a non-exclusive, royalty-free right to use, copy, modify, and distribute the Code and derivative versions of it.

When using or distributing the Code or derivative versions, you must:

1. attribute `langonginc` in a reasonable and clear manner;
2. retain this copyright notice, the full text of this license, and all existing rights notices; and
3. distribute derivative versions only under non-commercial, attribution terms no broader than this license, without removing or circumventing its restrictions.

### 3. Prohibited Uses

No company, enterprise, or other for-profit organization may use, copy, modify, distribute, or otherwise exploit the Code, whether or not its specific use is directly fee-based, without prior written authorization from `langonginc`.

Any use intended to obtain commercial advantage, directly or indirectly, including sale, paid services, commercial products or services, marketing, promotion, or client services, is prohibited. Commercial or organizational use requires prior written authorization from `langonginc`.

### 4. Image Assets and Third-Party Rights

No rights in Image Assets are granted under this license. Copyright and other rights in Image Assets remain with their original rights holders, and users must comply with all conditions stated by those rights holders. Image Assets may not be used commercially without prior permission from the applicable original rights holder.

This license grants no rights to use third-party materials, trademarks, names, logos, likenesses, or other rights. Users are responsible for obtaining every authorization required for their intended use.

### 5. Reservation of Rights and Disclaimer

`langonginc` reserves all rights not expressly granted by this license. The Code is provided “as is,” without any express or implied warranty. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, `langonginc` is not liable for any loss arising from use of, or inability to use, the Code.

If there is any inconsistency between the Chinese and English texts of this license, the Chinese text prevails.
